            </owl:Class>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/helenoliver/ontologies/2026/2/figure8secondattempt#Flow"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A flow that steps from CAE/virtual testing to performance testing to mechanical testing.

The CAE/virtual testing may be conducted in parallel with the physical testing.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


