        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A flow that steps from CAE/virtual testing to procurement.

During this Flow, specifications may be sent to suppliers.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/helenoliver/ontologies/2026/2/figure8secondattempt#Flow_DesignActivity_CAE_VirtualTesting -->

