Often takes the form of a Loop.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Design and analysis using CAE simulation.</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/helenoliver/ontologies/2026/2/figure8secondattempt#Flow_DesignActivity_Procurement -->

